  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MF4-06 Improving water safety and security in climate change-affected islands in Kiribati</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engineers without Borders will work with in-country partners&#xa0;to recruit and train two i-Kiribati WASH (water,&#xa0;sanitation and hygiene) officers to implement Drinking Water Safety and Security Planning (DWSSP) in communities and households in the Gilbert Group, focusing on the islands with the highest drinking water vulnerability due to the effects of climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
